1
00:00:00,600 --> 00:00:02,583
This is AI;DR.

2
00:00:03,850 --> 00:00:04,860
Every 30 minutes,

3
00:00:04,860 --> 00:00:06,369
AI;DR reads its sources

4
00:00:06,369 --> 00:00:08,400
and skips any that keep failing.

5
00:00:08,850 --> 00:00:10,324
Vietnamese text is checked

6
00:00:10,324 --> 00:00:12,554
for syllables no Vietnamese word uses.

7
00:00:12,554 --> 00:00:14,316
Older stories too.

8
00:00:14,850 --> 00:00:17,985
Day card headlines never go below 23 px.

9
00:00:17,985 --> 00:00:19,900
Crowded tiles become rows.

10
00:00:20,350 --> 00:00:21,790
Before any email goes out,

11
00:00:21,790 --> 00:00:23,055
it is claimed first.

12
00:00:23,055 --> 00:00:24,239
If two runs overlap,

13
00:00:24,239 --> 00:00:25,862
only one sends.

14
00:00:26,350 --> 00:00:27,453
You can now follow

15
00:00:27,453 --> 00:00:30,701
AI;DR in any RSS reader.

16
00:00:31,350 --> 00:00:32,906
And on four and five story days,

17
00:00:32,906 --> 00:00:35,051
Telegram lists every story.

18
00:00:36,350 --> 00:00:37,209
Share a story,

19
00:00:37,209 --> 00:00:38,115
and its photo now

20
00:00:38,115 --> 00:00:40,190
fills half the card.

21
00:00:41,500 --> 00:00:44,179
The release notes list every change.
